Package: clifR
Type: Package
Title: Common Longitudinal ICU data Format Tools for R
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CLIF Consortium", role = "aut"),
    person("Aartik", "Sarma", email = "aartiksarma@example.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
    )
Description: An R port of the Python library clifpy for standardizing and
    analyzing critical care (ICU) data using the Common Longitudinal ICU data
    Format (CLIF), supporting schema versions 2.1 and 3.0. Provides tools for
    data quality assessment, unit conversion, clinical score calculation (SOFA,
    Charlson and Elixhauser comorbidity indices), wide dataset transformation,
    respiratory support waterfall processing, outlier handling, and encounter
    stitching. Results are cross-validated against the reference Python
    implementation. Designed for high-performance processing of large ICU
    datasets using DuckDB and Apache Arrow.
License: Apache License (>= 2.0)
